# Runway needs no API keys and no environment variables.
#
# Every data source is public and keyless:
#   EIA-930 hourly grid monitor files, ERCOT MIS reports (4CP, day-ahead prices via gridstatus),
#   the Open-Meteo historical weather archive, and U.S. Census TIGER/Line files.
# The repo ships a verified offline cache (data/), so the demo and the tests never touch the network.
#
# Nothing in this file is read by the code. It exists so a reviewer can confirm there is nothing to configure.
# To copy it anyway:  cp .env.example .env
